OL,3,GNEWSAMy 93-year-old mother waited 10
OL,4,Ahours on the floor for an ambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 93-year-old woman had to lie on the
OL,7,Ffloor for 10-and-a-half hours with
OL,8,Fbroken bones while waiting for an
OL,9,Fambulance.
OL,11,FMargaret Owen fell in her home on 4
OL,12,FOctober and her son Graham Anthony went
OL,13,Fover after getting a call from her
OL,14,Flifeline alarm at 06:15.
OL,16,FHe said an ambulance was called at
OL,17,F07:35, but a St John Ambulance worker
OL,18,Fonly came at the request of the Welsh
OL,19,FAmbulance Service at 15:30.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
