OL,3,GNEWSAMy 93-year-old mother waited 10
OL,4,Ahours on the floor for an ambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was another 90 minutes until an
OL,7,Fambulance came and took Margaret to
OL,8,Fhospital.
